                    "description": "Detonate every policy-designated executable artifact, including scripts, binaries, container images, plugins, and model-loader candidates, against a complete versioned case population inside a short-lived deny-by-default microVM or equivalent boundary. The detonation receives no production credentials or host-write path, exposes only policy-declared instrumented egress, and exports only attested raw behavioral observations plus measurement metadata bound to the artifact digest, analyzer image, sandbox profile, execution receipt, case population, and policy version. Unsupported artifacts, missing telemetry, suspected escape, or absent destruction and residue evidence leave the analysis unresolved and must not be treated as evidence that the artifact is benign.",
