                "responsibility": "Owns write authorization and enforcement at protected file-backed agent identity, primary-memory, and configuration surfaces through OS restrictions, a controlled writer, immutable baselines, reviewed diffs, rollback, and tamper evidence. Database-backed and vector-backed memory use the other AID-I-004 controls.",
