              "description": "At each context summarization, compaction, or distillation event, validate the compacted output before it can re-enter active or persistent context. Preserve security-critical constraints and provenance, detect carried-forward poisoned content, prevent raw-secret retention, and bind evidence to the input and output digests, model revision, transformation policy, and verification result. When the verifier cannot run or does not support the input, keep the summary quarantined.",
