                          "id": "AID-I-008.003",
                          "comparison": "AID-I-008.005 brokers authentication-bearing navigation and returns only a scoped session reference; AID-I-008.003 quarantines browser downloads and clipboard transfers.\nTreating a magic link as an ordinary download or clipboard item does not protect transaction binding, one-time replay state, redirect trust, or token secrecy."
